    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the underground city of Blackchapel, where misery and despair reign. Fortunately, you recently found a huge drill to take you to the surface. You'll need to fuel it with a mysterious substance, which can only be obtained by recovering bodies. Fight your way through the monsters to recover the bodies of the victims they left behind. If they try to contact you, don't respond; they can understand you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Bodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to make your way through the dark alleys of Blackchapel to find bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform bodies into black phosphors at the Blackchapel General Processing Plant to fuel your motorized drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refuel Your Drill and\u00a0Flee to the surface</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power your motorized drill to escape this hell and return to the surface abandoned for far too long.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the underground city of Blackchapel, where misery and despair reign. Fortunately, you recently found a huge drill to take you to the surface. You'll need to fuel it with a mysterious substance, which can only be obtained by recovering bodies. Fight your way through the monsters to recover the bodies of the victims they left behind. If they try to contact you, don't respond; they can understand you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Bodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to make your way through the dark alleys of Blackchapel to find bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform bodies into black phosphors at the Blackchapel General Processing Plant to fuel your motorized drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refuel Your Drill and\u00a0Flee to the surface</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power your motorized drill to escape this hell and return to the surface abandoned for far too long.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this co-op horror game, you'll have to dodge monsters of all kinds to recover the bodies they left behind and transform them into a mysterious substance to feed your motorized drill. You'll finally have the means to save yourself from this cursed city. But be careful, monsters can understand you.",
